          "checks": "Read full combat step-by-step sidebar, 6-second rounds, surprise per creature (no action/movement on first turn and no reaction until it ends), Dexterity initiative and ties, move plus one action, bonus-action availability/one per turn/denied when actions denied, one free object interaction then action, and reaction reset at start of YOUR next turn."
