          "checks": "Movement subtraction and split attacks; switching speeds subtracts all movement already used; difficult terrain costs +1 foot even with multiple obstacles; standing costs half speed and requires enough movement, prone crawl+terrain costs3; all object examples read. Enemy-space passage requires >=2 size difference, never willingly end in occupied space; flight fall exceptions hover/magic; all size table values/spacing and squeeze extra cost/disadvantages checked."
        },
